  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sino-Dutch cooperation in the Solar greenhouse in Shouguang: research</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to research the improvement of cultivation, production and quality in traditional Chinese solar greenhouses by introducing modern Dutch techniques.The specific purpose of this project is to advise on the set-up and execution of the experiment and to compose the research report so that qualitative and reliable results are obtained and presented according to the high standards of Wageningen University &amp; Research (WUR).</narrative>
  </description>
